DC - Council wars/INTRFACE/ONLINEBG.GIF
DC - Council wars/INTRFACE/REPLAYE
DC - Council wars/INTRFACE/REPLAYBG.GIF
DC - Council wars/INTRFACE/LOADALLE

# the deprecated patched Classic build (1 Oct 2026, removed from the installer 5 Oct 2026): a copy built by the Python tools stays out
DC - Council wars/Dark Colony.exe

# since 2 Oct 2026 every resolution's interface set lives in its own folder HD_<height>P (UW_ for the ultra-wide sizes;
# doc 10.61), and since 5 Oct 2026 the repository ships NO patcher output at all (maintainer: "wipe out a patched files from
# repo. customer must generate all of them by themselves!"): the patched executables, every resolution's interface folder
# (the 1024x768 set HD_0768P was committed 2-5 Oct 2026), the OZI save-folder marker and the pre-October INTRF_HD layout
# are written by the installer - INSTALL.CMD builds them from the untouched originals and the resources in patcher/
/DC - Council wars/Dark Colony Ultimate.exe
/Dark Colony - Map editor/Dark Colony Map Editor.exe
